Package: gh-dork
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, python, python-pip, rust, make, openssl, pkg-config, python-cryptography
Section: recon
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/molly/gh-dork
Description: GitHub dorking tool
 gh-dork is a command-line tool for searching GitHub repositories
 using dorks. Supports user, organization, and repository filtering,
 with output to files and optional authentication via GitHub token.
